        "T58xbs00Ny4ntMQW": {
          "active_cost": "20 MP",
          "active_description": "<p>Deal <strong>Fire</strong> damage to all targets <strong>Grappled</strong> by you, consuming them in a violent eruption of flame. Removes <strong>Grappled</strong> from all targets afterward.</p><p><em>Can only be used while Grappling a creature.</em></p><p><strong>Blaze ―</strong> Consume all <strong>Burn</strong> stacks on the target. This attack deals bonus <strong>Fire</strong> damage equal to 【<strong>Burn Stack × 10</strong>】.</p>",
